kills-drama-soundtrack","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8b06289a8c21","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"付费卡点设计策略","description":"付费卡点是微短剧商业化的命脉。设计得好，观众觉得\"这钱花得值\"；设计得差，观众觉得\"被骗了\"然后弃剧。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["short-drama","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/short-drama/references/paywall-design.md","ext":".md","pack":"short-drama","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8b2c9aa95168","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"剧情分析格式示例","description":"以下是 `analysis.md` 的标准格式。","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["OmniMux-skills-drama-so…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack/references/analysis-example.md","ext":".md","pack":"OmniMux-skills-drama-soundtrack","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8d3fe8b339bb","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"连续短剧的人物、切入与跨集记忆","description":"1. 使用方式与规则分级 2. 先建前史储备，再选叙事切入窗口 3. 用人物驱动力预测选择 4. 把人物变化写成可追踪的压力测试 5. 每集必须产生局部戏剧结果 6. 管理信息权限与铺垫债务 7. 用双轨节奏安排张弛 8. 建立可恢复的跨集记忆 9. 合成示例 10. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-develop/references/serial-character-and-memory.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-develop","bytes":null}},{"id":"knowledge-storyboard-8d543649cd31","category":"knowledge","sub_category":"storyboard","name":"短剧对白方法","description":"1. 对白的工作定义与规则分级 2. 先写议程，再写句子 3. 台词是一种行动 4. 潜台词来自已知差与风险 5. 信息如何进入冲突 6. 人物声音如何区分 7. 让对话改变权力与关系 8. 动作、停顿、打断与沉默 9. 高密度对白场景 10. 对白修订流程 11. 合成示例 12. 失败征兆与审查问题","cover_url":"","media_url":"","media_type":"other","tags":["drama-skills-short-dram…","短剧拆镜"],"meta":{"source":"local-file","source_path":"skills/drama-skills-short-drama-write/references/dialogue-craft.md","ext":".md","pack":"drama-skills-short-drama-write","bytes":null}},{"i